## WIKI1 — A whole-path condition over up to 10 hops of chains thousands long: a larger GIT2, the cost of extracting paths
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1..10 fan-out=low variable-length aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: r.text_bytes | R4 path: x.text_bytes | R6 aggregate / sort: o.page_id

### WIKI1 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(o.page_id, chains)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[chains DESC, o.page_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: o.page_id | count(*) AS chains]
  :       GetProperty(o.page_id) [node:Revision]
  :         Filter((o.text_bytes >= 100000))
  :           GetProperty(o.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
  :             VarLengthExpand((r)-[_r0:PREV*1..10]->(o:Revision)) seg[all(x IN nodes WHERE (x.text_bytes >= 100000))]
  :               Filter((r.text_bytes >= 100000))
  :                 Filter((r.text_bytes >= 500000))
  :                   GetProperty(r.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
  :                     EntityScan(r:Revision)

### WIKI1 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[chains DESC, o.page_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: o.page_id | count(*) AS chains]
      StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o, o.page_id)
        : GetProperty(o.page_id) [node:Revision]
        :   Filter((o.text_bytes >= 100000))
        :     GetProperty(o.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
        :       Argument(o)
        Coord Filter(all(x IN nodes(_seg__r0) WHERE (x.text_bytes >= 100000)))
          ListFetch[mysql] _seg__r0.nodes.text_bytes from _seg__r0 [elem:Revision]
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(r) out=(r, _seg__r0, o)
              : VarLengthExpand((r)-[_r0:PREV*1..10]->(o:Revision)) emit _seg__r0
              :   Argument(r)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(r)
                : Filter((r.text_bytes >= 100000))
                :   Filter((r.text_bytes >= 500000))
                :     GetProperty(r.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
                :       EntityScan(r:Revision)

