## WIKI3 — Two hops narrowed only by a middle version: the cost when the middle condition is off graph and no start is fixed
traits: start=narrowed in the middle hops=2 fan-out=medium aggregate Top-20 | R3 middle: r.timestamp, r.text_bytes | R6 aggregate / sort: c.name, p.page_id

### WIKI3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(c.name, pages)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[pages DESC, c.name ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: c.name | count(DISTINCT p.page_id) AS pages]
  :       GetProperty(p.page_id) [node:Page]
  :         GetProperty(c.name) [node:Contributor]
  :           Expand((r)<-[_r1:HAS_REVISION]-(p:Page))
  :             Expand((r)<-[_r0:EDITED]-(c:Contributor))
  :               Filter((r.text_bytes >= 100000))
  :                 GetProperty(r.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
  :                   Filter((r.timestamp >= "2023-01-01"))
  :                     GetProperty(r.timestamp) [node:Revision]
  :                       EntityScan(r:Revision)

### WIKI3 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[pages DESC, c.name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: c.name | count(DISTINCT p.page_id) AS pages]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(p) out=(p, p.page_id)
        : GetProperty(p.page_id) [node:Page]
        :   Argument(p)
        Fetch[mysql] in=(c) out=(c, c.name)
          : GetProperty(c.name) [node:Contributor]
          :   Argument(c)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(r) out=(r, c, p)
            : Expand((r)<-[_r1:HAS_REVISION]-(p:Page))
            :   Expand((r)<-[_r0:EDITED]-(c:Contributor))
            :     Argument(r)
            StoreQuery[mysql] out=(r)
              : Filter((r.text_bytes >= 100000))
              :   GetProperty(r.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
              :     Filter((r.timestamp >= "2023-01-01"))
              :       GetProperty(r.timestamp) [node:Revision]
              :         EntityScan(r:Revision)

