## WIKI4 — A condition on the vertex after a variable-length chain (middle): how chain expansion and boundaries combine
traits: start=filtered scan hops=2..4 fan-out=low variable-length aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: r.text_bytes | R3 middle: o.timestamp | R6 aggregate / sort: d.name

### WIKI4 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(d.name, edits)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[edits DESC, d.name ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: d.name | count(*) AS edits]
  :       GetProperty(d.name) [node:Contributor]
  :         Expand((o)<-[_r1:EDITED]-(d:Contributor))
  :           Filter((o.timestamp >= "2020-01-01"))
  :             GetProperty(o.timestamp) [node:Revision]
  :               VarLengthExpand((r)-[_r0:PREV*1..3]->(o:Revision))
  :                 Filter((r.text_bytes >= 500000))
  :                   GetProperty(r.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
  :                     EntityScan(r:Revision)

### WIKI4 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[edits DESC, d.name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: d.name | count(*) AS edits]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(d) out=(d, d.name)
        : GetProperty(d.name) [node:Contributor]
        :   Argument(d)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o)
          : Filter((o.timestamp >= "2020-01-01"))
          :   GetProperty(o.timestamp) [node:Revision]
          :     Argument(o)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(r) out=(r, d, o) weighted
            : Expand((o)<-[_r1:EDITED]-(d:Contributor))
            :   VarLengthExpand((r)-[_r0:PREV*1..3]->(o:Revision))
            :     Argument(r)
            StoreQuery[mysql] out=(r)
              : Filter((r.text_bytes >= 500000))
              :   GetProperty(r.text_bytes) [node:Revision]
              :     EntityScan(r:Revision)

